// The build.omg protocol is EXACTLY `machine build(b: &mut Build)` -- one
// parameter. A second parameter has no build-time argument to bind, so the
// shared project-entry projection rejects before build-time evaluation (never
// silently ZII the extra parameter). The malformed entry can never project a
// dependency row, so this program stays deliberately dependency-free: its
// pinned rejection must not rest on a bundled-library import with no edge.
machine main() { }
